{"id": "DdtDUn_TWYX", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "👇 Did you already know this? Tell us in the comments! \n\n🪔 Did you know? Ganesh Visarjan as we know it today is actually a relatively recent tradition. 👀\n\nFor centuries, Ganesh Chaturthi was celebrated differently across India. The grand, public celebrations and mass visarjan processions we see today took shape much later.\n\nSo… when did this tradition really begin, and why? 🤔\n\nWatch till the end to discover the story behind one of India’s most iconic festivals. 🇮🇳🐘\n\n#GaneshChaturthi #GanpatiBappaMorya #GaneshVisarjan #IndianHistory #sanatan", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1790325783, "like_count": 74, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1442958617784937a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 81.522, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNKABnJCYDq2lKibXRyMSKP-vsbh_vrl-pfutY5RpRUwcC324JYrwppkrIgRKU9xYituDFSNsD4SB0uZtE_w0OgD1NlV4-tpfkIa08.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdqwZObrQTv0MGWfqZGejuediy2LztJL3_4oytjBwNEU23cHhU2TfVF-PXReLpP_8emi4hbe7RaFWpkxv3ZbA4yl&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Mn6H7B5ryAcQ7kNvwFlrp2H&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=UlZDfHRFPJEE17CR3qgXGw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTLFBHphYIVe0bmoGLBoH5bZxsEhq9z8XTFlYdpHPLGQw&oe=6AF43954", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 81.522, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mo